:: Fishing Pier Wave
<<wetLower 120>>
<<effects>>
<<if $worn.lower.type.includes("naked")>>
	A large wave crashes against the base of the pier, sending a cold spray up around your bare legs.
<<else>>
	A large wave crashes against the base of the pier, sending a cold spray up around your feet and soaking your $worn.lower.name.
<</if>>
